tral-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-neutral-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-neutral-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Features.tsx":"import { Camera, Home, Briefcase, BookOpen } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport default function Features() {\n  return (\n    <section id=\"features\" className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Services</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Wellpoint keeps panel sizes small so every visit gets a full 30 minutes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n          <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600\">\n              <Camera size={18} />\n            </div>\n            <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Annual physicals</h3>\n            <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Thorough checkups with same-week scheduling.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600\">\n              <Home size={18} />\n            </div>\n            <h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-900\">Chronic care management</h3>\n            <p classNa