nded-full bg-sky-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sky-700 transition-colors\">Get in touch</a>\n            <a href=\"#features\" className=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors\">View schedule</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-50 ring-1 ring-sky-100\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\">\n          <div className=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1\">\n            <p className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Summit Conference</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm text-slate-500\">Summit brings 800 operators together for talks that actually change how they work.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Events</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/schedule\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Schedule</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Legal</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Privacy</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Terms</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Summit Conference. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sky-600\">\n            <span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600\" /> Built with webma\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Talk to Summit Conference</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">We usually reply within a few hours.</p>\n      <form\n        className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"\n        onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}\n      >\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-sky-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sky-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Catalog.tsx":"export default function Catalog() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Schedule</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Summit brings 800 operators together for talks that actually change how they work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Opening keynote</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">9:00am — main stage.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Workshop track</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">11:00am–3:00pm — hands-on sessions.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Networking reception</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">6:00pm — rooftop terrace.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Closing panel</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">4:00pm — main stage.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/About.tsx":"export default function About() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 to-sky-100 \" />\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">About Summit Conference</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-slate-600\">Summit brings 800 operators together for talks that actually change how they work.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Testimonial.tsx":"export default function Testimonial() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center\">\n      <p className=\"font-sans text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-slate-900\">&ldquo;Summit Conference is exactly what they promise — nothing more, nothing less.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div className=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n        <div className=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-sky-100\" />\n        <div className=\"text-left\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Nadia Farouk</p>\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Guest</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/PageHeader.tsx":"export default function PageHeader() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\">\n        <h1 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-4xl\">Schedule</h1>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-500\">Summit brings 800 operators together for talks that actually change how they work.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"slug":"index","path":"/","name":"Home","sections":["Navbar","Hero","About","Testimonial","Footer"]},{"slug":"schedule","path":"/schedule","name":"Schedule","sections":["Navbar","PageHeader","Catalog","Footer"]},{"slug":"contact","path":"/contact","name":"Contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb),
